From 371db9c7c72e50d7ddd320b5e7151303fbd8a18c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:32:15 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): hovering a Geometry-tab selection highlights it in
 the viewport

The row hover set geo_hover while the properties pane drew, but the shell
cleared it at frame start and the viewport drew first, so the highlight never
reached the draw. The viewport now reads last frame's value (geo_hover_drawn,
a repaint requested on change) and draws it strongly (halo + 3.5 px magenta,
both themes). The remove button and the whole row light the pick too.

Fixes #1507

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
